  "title": "Intentionality is a biological phenomenon",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "a1aa2839-775a-4924-91dc-46102571a95f",
      "text": "Whatever else intentionality is, it is a biological phenomenon, as causally dependent on the specific biochemistry of its origins as lactation or photosynthesis. Mental states are a product of the operation of the brain, as a program is not a product of a computer.",
